{#
    The heading of every page except the feature pages (Step 7d, 13 October
    2026): one identical style, as Contact and Terms & Conditions: the title
    uppercase in Special Elite (.ll-heading, 22–32px), at the page's top
    padding, with an optional item on its right (aside: e.g. a count, a
    reference or a "← Back" link), then exactly 32px to the page's first
    content, which starts with the thin rule (border-t border-ll-line pt-4).

    Options:
      title  the heading
      aside  optional, shown on the right of the title (HTML)
      gap    the page's gap between its sections (default 2rem), so the
             32px stays the same on every page
#}
<div class="ll-page-heading flex justify-between items-baseline gap-x-4 gap-y-2 flex-wrap" style="margin-bottom: calc(32px - {{ gap|default('2rem') }})">
    <h1 class="ll-heading text-[clamp(22px,2vw,32px)]">{{ title }}</h1>
    {% if aside|default('') is not empty %}<div class="ll-page-heading-aside">{{ aside|raw }}</div>{% endif %}
</div>
